(2. Problem Statement) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(Retail traders know they should journal, but most do not do it consistently. Manual) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 706 Tm
(journaling is slow, repetitive, and emotionally uncomfortable after losses. When traders) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 692 Tm
(do journal, the records are incomplete and do not connect execution, psychology, setup) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 678 Tm
(rules, and P&L.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 664 Tm
(So traders cannot answer the questions that matter:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 650 Tm
(- Which market, session, setup, or instrument actually makes me money?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 636 Tm
(- Am I following my plan or trading emotionally?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 622 Tm
(- How much do FOMO, revenge trading, overconfidence, and broken rules cost me?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 608 Tm
(- Which mistakes repeat most often?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 594 Tm
(- What should I change next week?) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 580 Tm
(Edgecipline removes the journaling friction \(screenshot -> structured trade\) and turns) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 566 Tm
(the journal into coaching.) Tj
/FR 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 34 Tm
(Edgecipline PRD | 6) Tj
ET
endstream
