(4. Personas) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(Persona 1: The Inconsistent Retail Trader) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 703 Tm
(Trades often, no reliable journal, remembers big wins and losses emotionally. Needs fast) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 689 Tm
(logging, clear P&L and win rate, simple feedback on repeated mistakes, and a low-friction) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 675 Tm
(mobile experience.) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 661 Tm
(Persona 2: The Discipline-Focused Trader) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 644 Tm
(Has a strategy and rules but breaks them. Cares about process over outcome. Needs setup) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 630 Tm
(checklists, plan-adherence analytics, psychology tags, streaks, and a weekly review.) Tj
/FB 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 616 Tm
